  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_01",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "よし、集中モードにしよう。机の上と頭の中、両方を少しだけ狭くする感じ。",
      "translatedText": "Okay, let us switch into focus mode. Like narrowing both the desk and your mind a little.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "pose": "glasses_adjust", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "start_focus_001_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_02",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "最初の目標は大きくしないで。開始できたら、まず勝ち。",
      "translatedText": "Do not make the first goal large. If you can begin, that is already the first win.",
      "emotion": "warm",
      "presentation": { "expression": "warm", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "start_focus_001_03"
    },
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_03",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "通知、余計なタブ、気になるもの。ひとつ減らせるなら、今減らそう。",
      "translatedText": "Notifications, extra tabs, tempting things. If you can remove one, remove it now.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Clear one distraction.",
          "nextId": "start_focus_001_clear",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "environment", "stat": "focusAtmosphere", "amount": 0.3, "op": "add" },
            { "target": "player", "stat": "focusEnergy", "amount": 0.2, "op": "add" }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Start now.",
          "nextId": "start_focus_001_start_now",
          "statChanges": [
            { "target": "player", "stat": "taskProgress", "amount": 0.2, "op": "add" },
            { "target": "altera", "stat": "engagement", "amount": 0.1, "op": "add" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "nextId": "start_focus_001_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_clear",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "いいね。一つ減らすだけで、集中の入口が見えやすくなる。",
      "translatedText": "Good. Removing just one thing makes the entrance to focus easier to see.",
      "emotion": "happy",
      "presentation": { "expression": "happy", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "start_focus_001_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_start_now",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "その勢い、捕まえよう。準備は最低限でいい。",
      "translatedText": "Let us catch that momentum. Minimum preparation is enough.",
      "emotion": "focused",
      "presentation": { "expression": "focused", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "start_focus_001_04"
    },
    {
      "id": "start_focus_001_04",
      "speaker": "altera",
      "text": "準備ができたら、私は静かにする。必要になったら呼んで。",
      "translatedText": "When you are ready, I will be quiet. Call me if you need me.",
      "emotion": "gentle",
      "presentation": { "expression": "gentle", "gazeTarget": "player" },
      "language": "japanese",
      "audioPath": "",
      "choices": [],
      "nextId": "end"
    }
  ]
}
